,"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[256,266],"text":"自衛CANNEWS"},{"indices":[267,273],"text":"自衛官募集"},{"indices":[274,281],"text":"高校生特派員"},{"indices":[282,287],"text":"VLOG"},{"indices":[288,295],"text":"川口市立高校"},{"indices":[296,300],"text":"自衛隊"}],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"mod.go.jp/gsdf/jieikanbo…","expanded_url":"https://www.mod.go.jp/gsdf/jieikanbosyu/jcannews/","indices":[230,253],"url":"https://t.co/hn4ZjeUSL2"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMjUxNDk3OTc0MTM5ODIyMDg=","text":"今回は、高校生特派員の「番外編VLOG」。\n食堂、隊舎、車両整備、大型車両、偵察部隊――。\n音楽隊だけではない、自衛隊のさまざまな現場を高校生が取材しました。\n \n「自衛隊って、体力だけじゃなく勉強も多いんだ」\n「実際に話してみると、思っていたより距離が近い」\n \n見て、聞いて、話して、少しずつ変わっていく高校生たちの自衛官へのイメージ。\n本編とは違う、取材の一日をVLOGでご覧ください。\n \n11/27は合同演奏を公開予定。\n \n🔗自衛CAN NEWS\nhttps://t.co/hn4ZjeUSL2\n \n#自衛CANNEWS #自衛官募集 #高校生特派員 #VLOG #川口市立高校 #自衛隊"}}},"rest_id":"2125149797481119887","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"13126","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"user_id_str":"268732024"},"rest_id":"2125152846429741180","source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"4501","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2125152846429741180","sortIndex":"2125416080338845640"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":0},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1674231387166220288/iK7GwtIr_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.co