がテーマ📻\n元ポストのリンクからお聴きいただけます。\n\n全国でノウフクの日関連イベント開催中🥰\nお待ちしております！\n\n詳しくはこちら↓\nhttps://t.co/LatdNXFm90","id_str":"2125132620862554426","is_quote_status":true,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"quoted_status_id_str":"2125089332361134535","quoted_status_permalink":{"display":"x.com/gov_online/sta…","expanded":"https://twitter.com/gov_online/status/2125089332361134535","url":"https://t.co/blrmVlezue"},"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":5,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"2335919749"},"quoted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"photo_image_full_size_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2125089336903483392/87l54Hlv?format=jpg&name=800x419","width":800},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2125089336903483392/87l54Hlv?format=jpg&name=280x150","width":267},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"description","value":{"string_value":"11月29日は「ノウフクの日」。「農福連携」は、農業と福祉が力を合わせることで、農業の働き手を増やし、障害のあるかたの働く機会を広げていく取組です。政府広報提供ラジオ「杉浦太陽・松井玲奈　日曜まなびより」では、自社栽培したお米を活用し、バームクーヘンなどの米粉スイーツの製造・販売を通じて、農福商工連携を実現している企業のかたのお話を交えながら、農福連携についてご紹介します。","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"www.gov-online.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":320,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2125089336903483392/87l54Hlv?format=jpg&name=800x320_1","width":569},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"summary_photo_image_small","value":{"image_value":{"height":202,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2125089336903483392/87l54Hlv?format=jpg&name=386x202","width":386},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_original","value":{"image_value":{"height":540,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2125089336903483392/87l54Hlv?format=jpg&name=orig","width":960},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"site","value":{"scribe_key":"publisher_id","type":"USER","user_value":{"id_